 what was exercised against Azure. TTFA values are single first-run data points, not benchmarks. The Asterisk probe ran against a local uvicorn server, so it is static-only. The unit suite also covers the telephony adapters, shared admission counter, RAG backends and infra guards." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDF5;strokeColor=#C8A400;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#201F1E;fontFamily=Segoe UI;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1138" width="1820" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>